              <p>{example.summary}</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      <aside class="vg-market-note vg-market-note--examples">
        <strong>The conclusion comes last:</strong> establish what the guitar is, authenticate the finish, inventory the
        parts and repairs, grade the condition, and only then compare it with the correct slice of the market.
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="vg-section" id="selling-options">
    <div class="vg-inner">
      <h2 class="vg-head">Selling Your Vintage Stratocaster</h2>
      <div class="vg-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="vg-grid">
        <article class="vg-card">
