            Let a dealer handle the photos, the listing, the authentication, and the buyers. I offer{" "}
            <a href="/consignment/">consignment</a> from as low as 8% on top-tier instruments.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="vg-card">
          <h3>Sell It Outright</h3>
          <p>
            The quickest, simplest route: a fair cash offer and payment up front, with me handling shipping or
            pickup. <a href="/sell-my-fender-guitar/">Sell your Fender to me</a> directly.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="vg-card">
          <h3>Sell It Privately</h3>
          <p>
